            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "Home Bancorp (HBCP) Q3 2025 Earnings Transcript",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Yesterday afternoon, we reported third quarter net income of $12.4 million or $1.59 per share, up $0.14 per share from the second quarter and $0.41 from a year ago.  Home Bank's efficiency ratio also improved in the third quarter and is now back down below 60%.  Loans decreased by $58 million in the third quarter as we saw payoffs and paydowns that were $52 million higher than average paydowns over the last 6 quarters.",
