            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "Home Bancorp HBCP Q1 2025 Earnings Call Transcript",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "First quarter margin expansion was driven by a 13 basis point decline in the cost of interest-bearing liabilities, stable yields on interest-earning assets and loan growth.  Deposits increased in the first quarter at a 7% annualized rate due to seasonal inflows of public funds and continued effort on our part to fund our loan growth with core deposits.  CDs also increased and we've had good success using our CD product to attract and retain customer deposits since the end of the pandemic.",
