        {
          "id": "fadc936d-9214-36e2-baa2-c824bbb87347",
          "content": {
            "id": "fadc936d-9214-36e2-baa2-c824bbb87347",
            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "Home Bancorp HBCP Q4 2024 Earnings Call Transcript",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Yesterday afternoon we reported fourth quarter net income of 9.7 million or $1.21 per share with net interest margin expanding for the third consecutive quarter to 3.82%.  Fourth quarter's NIM expansion was driven by a 15 basis point decline in the cost of interest bearing liabilities, an increase in the average non-interest bearing deposits, stable yields on interest earning assets, and a slight increase in our loans to deposit ratio.  After a slow October, loan growth picked up in November and December resulting in fourth quarter annualized loan growth of 7.5%, which helped push our 2024 loan growth to 5.3%.",
